// Title: Potential WWlib.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: e2e01011-5910-4267-9c3b-4149ed5479cf
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_wwlib.yml
